-- the three Foldy–Wouthuysen terms, coefficients of Z⁴α² hartree:
-- −p⁴/8 = −½⟨(E − V)²⟩ = −½(E² + 2E⟨1/r⟩ + ⟨1/r²⟩) (V = −1/r);
-- Darwin (π/2)|ψ(0)|² = 1/(2n³) at l = 0; spin–orbit ½⟨1/r³⟩ L·S for l ≥ 1
fw-p4 : Nat → Nat → BQ
fw-p4 nn l = bq-mul (fn-nq 1 2) (bq-add (bq-add (bq-mul (fn-e nn) (fn-e nn)) (bq-mul (fn-q 2 1) (bq-mul (fn-e nn) (fn-r1 nn)))) (fn-r2 nn l))
